{"v":1,"id":"6ee349067f78","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"When you said, “What’s the deal?”","s":22.27,"e":27.45},{"t":"you showed Me where you stood.","s":27.56,"e":32.38},{"t":"You kept the rules to keep yourself,","s":32.44,"e":37.93},{"t":"not because you knew My good.","s":38.03,"e":43.51},{"t":"You trimmed your lamp by habit,","s":43.61,"e":48.52},{"t":"not by hunger for My flame -","s":48.6,"e":54.3},{"t":"You spoke My Name with practiced lips,","s":54.34,"e":58.23},{"t":"but never sought Me as i really am..","s":58.29,"e":64.19},{"t":"You thought My patience meant My favor,","s":64.21,"e":69.31},{"t":"thought nearness came from calling “Lord.”","s":69.36,"e":74.78},{"t":"You built a world of borrowed light -","s":74.83,"e":80.63},{"t":"and claimed it as reward.","s":80.7,"e":86.37},{"t":"You did not know Me,","s":86.39,"e":88.45},{"t":"though I saw straight through you.","s":88.48,"e":91.76},{"t":"You kept Me distant,","s":91.84,"e":93.82},{"t":"with custom made truths.","s":93.89,"e":97.01},{"t":"You loved a likeness,","s":97.07,"e":99.0},{"t":"not the life I gave…","s":99.06,"e":102.06},{"t":"You did not know Me -","s":102.14,"e":104.37},{"t":"yet still, I am not changed.","s":104.42,"e":108.95},{"t":"I hear the whisper rising in you:","s":108.97,"e":114.41},{"t":"“But I meant well… I tried.”","s":111.34,"e":119.5},{"t":"You shaped a god to fit your wants,","s":119.56,"e":125.27},{"t":"and called that hope your guide.","s":125.35,"e":130.56},{"t":"You wanted Me for comfort,","s":130.66,"e":135.49},{"t":"not to walk where I would lead -","s":135.57,"e":141.43},{"t":"Crosses decorate your halls,","s":141.47,"e":145.91},{"t":"Pick up yours and follow me.","s":145.95,"e":150.91},{"t":"And when you cried, “You left us here!”","s":150.92,"e":156.68},{"t":"you spoke from wounds you chose -","s":156.74,"e":161.86},{"t":"For pride locked your inner door","s":161.9,"e":167.16},{"t":"long before Mine closed.","s":167.26,"e":169.1},{"t":"You did not know Me,","s":169.11,"e":174.76},{"t":"though I saw straight through you.","s":174.79,"e":177.99},{"t":"You kept Me distant,","s":178.05,"e":179.99},{"t":"with custom made truths.","s":180.06,"e":183.18},{"t":"You loved a likeness,","s":183.24,"e":185.15},{"t":"not the life I gave…","s":185.19,"e":188.13},{"t":"You did not know Me -","s":188.19,"e":190.42},{"t":"yet I am forever the same.","s":190.49,"e":194.63},{"t":"I have not forsaken you,","s":194.65,"e":196.84},{"t":"but you have not yet turned.","s":196.92,"e":198.84},{"t":"You feel abandoned in your dark -","s":198.92,"e":201.51},{"t":"but this is how pride burns.","s":201.6,"e":204.42},{"t":"My child, I was beside you","s":204.5,"e":206.74},{"t":"when your lips cried out My name…","s":206.82,"e":209.69},{"t":"But nearness isn’t claimed by habit -","s":209.77,"e":213.49},{"t":"it’s forged in holy flame.","s":213.5,"e":224.32},{"t":"You did not know Me,","s":224.34,"e":226.4},{"t":"though I saw straight through you.","s":226.43,"e":229.77},{"t":"You kept Me distant,","s":229.83,"e":231.77},{"t":"with custom made truths.","s":231.84,"e":235.04},{"t":"You loved an image,","s":235.1,"e":236.76},{"t":"not My living way…","s":236.86,"e":240.25},{"t":"But when you yield -","s":240.33,"e":242.4},{"t":"I will not stay away.","s":242.48,"e":246.25},{"t":"[Outro ]","s":244.81,"e":247.01},{"t":"(soft) When you want me as I am…","s":246.33,"e":258.56},{"t":"I’ll call your name again.","s":258.6,"e":268.27},{"t":"You did not know Me,","s":268.28,"e":270.27},{"t":"though I saw straight through you.","s":270.29,"e":273.5},{"t":"You kept Me distant,","s":273.56,"e":275.5},{"t":"with custom made truths.","s":275.56,"e":278.6},{"t":"You loved a likeness,","s":278.66,"e":280.58},{"t":"not the life I gave…","s":280.62,"e":283.55},{"t":"You did not know Me -","s":283.61,"e":285.84},{"t":"My child, I can not change.","s":285.9,"e":288.09},{"t":"I can never change!","s":288.2,"e":290.19}],"match":null}
